9e9261fe415f6219d74eea46f844f8ce3bb21f5efeat(probes): a structure snapshot diff matches lines without their indent (#350)

A new wrapper element moves its children one level deeper. The line diff saw every
child line as removed and added, so a wrapper counted as all its children changed.
Lines are matched without their indent now: a wrapper is one added element, and the
shown diff keeps each line with its indent.


