eed71bbc5bd32bff3e1ab2a77a15ac9785b14de3perf(model): merge_base is linear; trusted_writers_checked skips a second signature check (#344)

merge_base compared every pair of common ancestors and walked the history for each:
quadratic, and the Changes page of the site calls it once per change (83.5 s for the
layr project in WASM). One walk from the parents of the common ancestors finds the
ones that are not best; the result is the same.

trusted_writers checks every record signature. Callers whose records a fetch or an
import checked already use trusted_writers_checked, which does not check them again.


